From: joethedev5 <deepsbx1@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:24:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/30] Relocate VM map store types into the 13432 header

Move the packed pointer, tree node/root, reservation and guard-object
type definitions and their packing macros out of
vm_map_store_internal.h into vm_map_store_types_internal.h, matching
the reference declaration file.  The public text is preserved verbatim;
vm_map_store_internal.h now includes the new header.

Clears the last duplicate-definition delta from the header
reconstruction.

Authored-By: joethedev5 <joeshmo@nunya.com>
